## Summary

Adds the Genie random event in a new module `content/events/random-events`.

- Every 1-2 hours of play a Genie appears beside the player, faces them and calls them by name.
- Talk-to hands over a lamp straight away (the lamp is delivered before the dialogue opens, so cancelling the dialogue or logging out cannot lose it; with a full inventory it drops to the floor). The Genie leaves on the next call tick.
- Rubbing the lamp gives 10 x the chosen skill's base level in XP; the message and the XP are the same number.
- Dismiss sends him away, and he leaves after a minute when ignored.
- `::randomevent` summons him and requires administrator rights.

Server-only ids are in the module's `gamevals.toml`: timers `random_event` and `random_event_genie`.

