## How it was tested

- The `random-events` module compiles and passes `spotlessCheck` locally on this branch; `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check` finds no conflicts.
- In game, on a local build of this branch with a desktop client, full inventory of 28 logs: Talk-to put "Your reward is: 1 x Lamp." in chat and the lamp on the floor under the player while the dialogue was open; the Genie was gone by the next call tick, with no call afterwards.
- Walking away from the open dialogue left no orphan Genie, and the lamp was still on the floor and could be picked up.
- Logging out with a Genie present left no orphan Genie.
- Rub: "Your wish has been granted! You have been awarded 10 Ranged XP!", and Ranged XP went from 0 to 10 at level 1.
- The refusal for a non-admin account was checked in code only (`requiredRights = Rights.ADMINISTRATOR`); every account on the local server is an administrator.

