## Screenshots / notes for reviewers

Data sources: OSRS Wiki (by the wiki's contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/): Random events, Genie, Transcript:Genie; RSProx recordings 3056 and 1718 of the event, read at the packet level, for the timings.

The lamp's XP uses the base level (`statBase`); the wiki says "current level". This is the one deviation from the wiki and is not in `docs/quirks.md`.

No tests are included.

Only the Genie is added; other random events could build on the same timer.

